WEBVTT

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:13.870
Can't focus. My body is still puzzled about what to do.

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:13.870
Shuuchuu dekitenaina mada karada ga mayotteirunda

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:17.630
I'm trembling. I can't stop even if I try to control myself.

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:17.630
Furueteitanja kontoroorushitatte burerunda

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:21.380
Although neither sun nor moon are on my side,

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:21.380
Taiyou mo tsuki mo nanmo kanzen ni kocchi muiteinaiga

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:22.800
"I've no choice but to try,"

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:22.800
Yarushikanainda

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.470
Those were the words I muttered to myself.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.470
Iikikaseruyouni sotto tsubuyaita

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:31.060
The odds aren't on my side, but running way'd be gutless.

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:31.060
Joukyou wa waruiga tada nigedasunja konjou nainaa

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:35.060
Even if I can't see the future, I'll just have to win it over with courage.

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:35.060
Tenbou wa naiga dokyou de kuria suru shika naiya

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:38.560
Need to keep distance from the target as I hold myself back.

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:38.560
Shoudou wa osaetamama taagetto to no kankaku sagure

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:41.860
All that's needed for victory is pride to win.

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:41.860
Hitsuyou na mon wa katsu puraido

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:44.950
Will we celebrate with the wine of victory

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:44.950
Ajiwau nowa shouri no bishu ka

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:48.950
Or'll we end up kissing their feet in defeat?

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:48.950
Soretomo haiboku no kujuu ka

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:52.700
There are two outcomes to everything.

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:52.700
Sou subete wa futatsu ni hitotsu

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:56.420
I want to control destiny.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:56.420
Ayatsuritai unmei no ito

00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:01.750
I need to seize the golden opportunity with my hands.

00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:01.750
Zekkou no goorudentaimu kono te de tsukame

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:05.840
I'll finish it up with my best poker face,

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:05.840
Konshin no pookaafeisu kimete shikakeruyo

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:10.800
And drag them into a world of illusions.

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:10.800
Iryuujon no sekai e hikizurikonde

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:17.140
I'll find my way out of this endless pressure game,

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:17.140
Saigennai puresshaageemu sururito nukete

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:21.150
And leap over the borderline of honor.

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:21.150
Eikou no boodaarain tobikoeru tameni

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:25.860
How many? What'll I need to sacrifice to make it happen?

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:25.860
Haumenii? Dorekurai no daishou ga iru?

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:30.120
What is the one thing I don't want to let go?

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:30.120
Tebanashitakunai mon wa dore?

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:50.080
I've got a bad feeling about this place.

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:54.830
Father! I brought a sacrifice!

00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:57.420
"Father"? So suddenly...

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:02.920
Who is it?

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:09.930
Dad?

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:13.460
Father

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:13.460
Father

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:46.840
Envy.

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:48.300
Envy?!

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.010
This is him?!

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:53.770
Brother!

00:02:57.140 --> 00:02:58.310
Brother!

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:01.400
Al?

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:05.070
Al in the armor... which means...

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:10.070
We were able to get back.

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:11.410
Yeah.

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:12.490
Brother!

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:13.660
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:14.330
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:17.290
I'm so glad to see you're safe!

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:15.410
That hurts, Al!

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:17.790
Your armor's hurting me!

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:25.090
It's just that I'm so glad to see you're alive...

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:29.630
You're right.

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:30.840
Sorry.

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:34.350
For worrying you.

00:03:39.350 --> 00:03:42.100
But where the heck are we?

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:44.110
What a surprise.

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:46.440
Humans came out of his stomach?

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:51.030
Hohen...heim?!

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:54.580
An arm and a leg made of steel, and a suit of armor.

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:00.670
Are you the Elric Brothers?

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.750
It's not him?

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:06.300
Are you mistaking me for somebody?

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:08.050
Hang on...

00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:10.050
Hohen...

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:14.550
Don't tell me you're talking about Van Hohenheim?

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:16.810
What is your relationship with him?

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:20.060
He's... our dad.

00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:24.310
Dad?!

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:28.780
What a surprise! He ended up having kids?!

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:37.620
But aren't your last names Elric?

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:39.620
Elric is our mother's maiden name!

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:41.750
I see.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:44.330
So, where is he now?

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:45.750
Hell if I know!

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:48.130
But more importantly, who the hell are you?!

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:50.050
You look just like Hohenheim!

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:52.260
There's no way he'd die.

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:52.680
Listen to me!

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:54.720
And he's even had kids...

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:54.260
Brother, this man is...

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:58.470
Oh? You're injured?

00:04:58.470 --> 00:05:00.640
And you're missing your left arm.

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:07.400
How's that?

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:08.480
Ow!

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:10.320
A broken bone, huh?

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.120
I-It's fixed.

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:23.410
Hey!

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:25.790
Oww!

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:27.630
Now for your ribs.

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:36.050
You two are important to us.

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:38.140
Don't be too reckless with your bodies, okay?

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:42.850
He used alchemy without a single hand motion.

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:45.100
And he didn't make the rest of my armor thinner, either...

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:47.980
In other words, it's not equivalent exchange.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:49.980
Who the hell are you?

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:52.990
It's unreal! How could your insides be in such a state?!

00:05:54.740 --> 00:05:56.610
I'm going to ask you the same exact question.

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:57.990
Who are you?

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:02.700
You can eat him.

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:03.750
Okay!

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:04.910
H-Hang on!

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:07.080
He's my friend!

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:10.380
I'm a human sacrifice, so don't kill him for my sake. Okay?

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:12.460
That's not my problem.

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:15.590
He's useless to me.

00:06:15.590 --> 00:06:17.010
What did you say?!

00:06:17.010 --> 00:06:21.350
Brother, the Homunculi call him "Father".

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:23.600
He's the one who created them.

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:24.560
What?!

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:26.980
Even though he patched us up...

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:29.110
I don't like it.

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:31.690
Your attitude...

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:35.240
You're the same as those who laugh at humans for being foolish.

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:40.280
Do you consider insects crawling about the Earth to be foolish?

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:47.420
Even if insects struggle, the difference between you and them is so great that you don't exactly give a damn.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:52.550
That's precisely how I feel about you humans.

00:06:56.340 --> 00:07:00.430
I appreciate you healing our wounds,
but I don't think I can get along with you!

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:02.970
Seems you're the cause of everything!

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:05.220
I'll take care of you quickly.

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:07.350
I can't be worrying about the small fry!

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:10.190
You're calling me small fry now, runt?

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:12.770
Runt?!

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:20.030
I've got their leader!

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:33.960
Ling!

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:36.800
What is going on?!

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:42.760
How can he use alchemy without a single hand motion?!

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:47.350
What a waste of time.

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:23.090
We can't use alchemy?!

00:08:23.590 --> 00:08:25.470
Ed! Al!

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:32.520
What did that geezer do?!

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:33.400
Why...

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:35.940
Why can't we use alchemy?!

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:41.450
Seriously, these tiny beings are unbelievable.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:44.990
They start to think they're at the top of the world as soon as they gain some power.

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:47.200
They don't even know what exactly they're using.

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:53.790
Do you really think all this prosperity was created with the powers of humans only?

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:57.000
How laughable, fools.

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:00.630
What the hell are you talking about?!

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:03.590
You promised you'd tell me as soon as we got out!

00:09:03.590 --> 00:09:04.760
What?

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:08.930
I don't remember making promises with you insects.

00:09:08.930 --> 00:09:10.060
You bastard...

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:12.600
You're talking too much, Envy.

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:13.770
Yeah, yeah...

00:09:15.810 --> 00:09:18.690
He could be good for the job.

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:23.570
I may be able to create another pawn.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:30.080
That's... a philosopher's stone!

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:31.200
What?!

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:33.460
So you're planning to do it, huh?

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:34.460
Do what?

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:36.830
He's creating a Homunculus.

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:41.170
He's going to inject the philosopher's stone into him.

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:45.050
If all goes well, a homunculus with a human base will be complete.

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:53.640
Well, most humans end up dying because they aren't capable of fighting the stone's power.

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:55.560
Like I'll let you!

00:09:57.310 --> 00:09:59.110
Let go, Envy!!

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:01.570
Dammit, what's going on?!

00:10:01.570 --> 00:10:03.530
Why can't we use alchemy?!

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:06.410
Hey, you!

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:07.780
Geezer! Stop it!

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:10.620
He has people waiting for his return!

00:10:10.620 --> 00:10:12.240
Let go!!!

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:19.790
Humans can't shoot me if I do this...

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:21.630
Right?

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:24.090
Damn you...

00:10:24.090 --> 00:10:25.470
It's fine! Don't shoot!

00:10:26.090 --> 00:10:28.470
Don't interfere.

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:29.640
This is fine by me!

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:30.890
What?

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:33.890
I came to this country looking for a philosopher's stone.

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:36.350
And he's just going to give it to me like that.

00:10:36.350 --> 00:10:37.900
It's exactly what I wished for!

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:39.270
What the hell are you saying?!

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:41.770
Oh? Sounds interesting.

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:44.530
Then as you wish, it's all yours.

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:47.320
Stop it!

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:57.370
Ling!

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:01.170
I... I told you not...

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:03.000
...to interfere!

00:11:06.920 --> 00:11:11.680
It's fine... Just wait for me...

00:11:13.510 --> 00:11:16.270
I'm the man who will become the Emperor of Xing...

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:17.480
...Ling Yao!

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:40.370
What the hell is a brat doing here?!

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:42.330
Ah, well.

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:44.340
Let me have your body.

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.050
I'll put it to good use.

00:11:46.710 --> 00:11:48.340
Fine...

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:50.550
It's all yours!

00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:51.550
What?

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:54.180
I'm saying that I'll accept you!

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:56.180
Wouldn't people normally be against it?

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:58.730
I'm going to become the Emperor of Xing.

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:03.770
How do you expect me to do that if I can't even accept a few dozen people in my body?!

00:12:05.940 --> 00:12:08.440
I like decisive guys.

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:10.400
But you'd better not regret it.

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:12.160
Regret?

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:18.160
If I return empty-handed, how could I possibly face my servant who cut her own arm off to save me?!

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:22.040
I want power...

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:27.170
Absolute power that will help me protect and gain more!

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:29.050
I knew the risks from the beginning!

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:33.090
I like your greed.

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:37.850
Well then, show me how prepared you are!

00:12:48.230 --> 00:12:49.190
Ling?

00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:54.320
Huh? Oh, the guy who owned this body?

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:58.950
Sorry, but now it belongs to me, Greed.

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:02.080
Not Ling, but...

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:03.960
Greed?!

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:15.470
You're that Greed?

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:19.100
What do you mean by "that" Greed?

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:20.640
You don't remember?!

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:22.140
The one at Dublith...

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:24.350
Yeah, so what Greed are you talking about?

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:27.110
The Greed that came before you.

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:29.480
Oh, I see.

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:31.030
Well, as you can see,

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:34.410
I'm a different Greed from the one you guys know.

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:36.120
What happened to Ling?

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:39.540
He was an interesting brat.

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:42.160
He accepted me in a matter of seconds.

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:47.170
No way! There's no way he's that easy to take control of!

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:49.340
Answer me! Ling!

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:50.710
Ling!!!

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:04.230
What?

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.390
No...

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.650
I don't like him...

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:10.770
He's a person, but at the same time, he's not!

00:14:12.190 --> 00:14:16.240
You're right, a lot of these guys aren't human.

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:19.780
Shao May!

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:21.790
I'm so glad to see you're safe!

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:23.660
Do you have any idea how worried I was?

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:27.790
Whoa, I don't really get it, but is this some tearful reunion?

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:35.130
It seems they aren't working together with the Homunculi.

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:37.720
Fullmetal Alchemist.

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:39.090
Huh? Where?

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:41.310
Where's Sir Edward?

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:42.310
Right there.

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:46.230
I don't see him anywhere!

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:47.850
I'm pointing right at him.

00:14:48.350 --> 00:14:51.360
That small one is the Fullmetal Alchemist.

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:13.340
You toyed with my pure heart, you midget!

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:15.170
Speak for yourself, midget!

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:15.590
PLACEHOLDER

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:18.340
What did you do to her, Brother?!

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:18.880
He's the Ishbalan I didn't get to eat.

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:19.970
I didn't do a thing!

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:21.800
The disobedient people, huh...

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:27.390
He's the one who uses destructive alchemy and continues to interfere with our plans, right?

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:29.850
Take care of them, Gluttony.

00:15:29.850 --> 00:15:32.610
He can't use alchemy right now.

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:34.610
Okay!

00:15:39.860 --> 00:15:40.610
What?!

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:42.200
I'll never forgive you!

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:46.410
You stepped all over a maiden's heart,
and on top of that, you kidnapped Shao May!

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:49.830
Divine punishment...

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:51.330
...for all of you!!!

00:15:55.210 --> 00:15:56.710
Lucky!

00:16:00.590 --> 00:16:02.720
We still can't use it!

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:04.100
What gives?!

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:07.100
How can you two use alchemy here?

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:09.600
What do you mean?

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:12.940
Seriously, what's going on?

00:16:12.940 --> 00:16:14.650
How can Scar and that little girl...

00:16:14.650 --> 00:16:15.730
I have no idea.

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:17.360
No idea, but...

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:20.360
This could be our chance to fill them in.

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:21.280
Scar!

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:26.790
I'll tell you the truth behind the Ishbal rebellion!

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:28.830
The truth?

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:31.790
The death of the child which became the trigger of the rebellion...

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:36.500
...was caused by him, disguised as a military officer!

00:16:38.170 --> 00:16:41.380
They're behind it all!

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:55.150
It seems like I'll have to ask you to explain this in detail.

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:04.530
Answer me.

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:07.830
Why did my people have to fall?

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:12.830
Depending on your answer, I'll send you to...

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:13.870
No.

00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:18.000
I won't send you to God, where my fellow Ishbalans reside!

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:21.420
Think of yourselves as undeserving of eternal rest or redemption!!!

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:30.430
Wow, amazing!

00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:32.600
Not bad for a human.

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:35.690
Greed, get rid of the intruders.

00:17:35.690 --> 00:17:36.940
Yeah, yeah...

00:17:42.690 --> 00:17:45.700
I refuse to believe it, Ling!

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:49.410
I'm Greed.

00:17:55.620 --> 00:17:56.630
That's...

00:17:56.630 --> 00:18:00.000
Could that be Ling from the Yao clan?

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:03.010
A little girl!

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:06.010
Soft body!

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:15.140
Hey you, how can you use alchemy?

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:21.860
Yes, you really are using it.

00:18:23.530 --> 00:18:25.280
Human destruction...

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:27.450
No, decomposition.

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:37.040
A second later, and I would have been...

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:39.330
Mr. Scar!

00:18:44.550 --> 00:18:47.510
Shao May... Run...

00:18:48.220 --> 00:18:50.180
You're mine!

00:18:51.890 --> 00:18:52.890
Are you okay?!

00:18:58.350 --> 00:19:00.650
I never asked you to save me...

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:02.690
What are you talking about?!

00:19:02.690 --> 00:19:05.650
They're ruthless toward humans who are of no benefit to them.

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:07.280
Hurry up and get out of here!

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:12.580
There's way too many of them!

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:20.000
You two didn't run away?!

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:30.430
Scar, could you take this girl and get out of here?

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:33.260
You're going to let me escape?

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:36.520
Even if I killed those doctors...

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:39.730
Yeah, I want to beat the hell out of you.

00:19:39.730 --> 00:19:42.770
To be honest, I don't even want to ask you for any favors.

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:45.530
But right now, it's more important to take this girl somewhere safe.

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:47.690
What will you do?

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:54.620
Apparently, my brother and I are important to them in some way.

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:58.120
Even if we stay here, they won't kill us.

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:03.670
Right now, I won't be able to protect
that girl and escape from here at the same time.

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:07.300
And I don't have the slightest intention of running away, either!

00:20:09.420 --> 00:20:11.180
He decomposed water?!

00:20:21.850 --> 00:20:24.690
Geez, let me know before you do stuff like that!

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:26.360
How reckless!

00:20:28.530 --> 00:20:32.200
Igniting hydrogen? That's clever of you.

00:20:34.530 --> 00:20:35.780
Where is he?

00:20:35.780 --> 00:20:37.830
Where did he go?!

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:38.910
I don't know!

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:41.370
Gluttony, track him by scent!

00:20:44.580 --> 00:20:47.210
You're out of lives?!

00:20:47.210 --> 00:20:48.670
You've died too much!

00:20:51.300 --> 00:20:53.220
That was a nice kick.

00:20:53.220 --> 00:20:55.800
I think this'll be more fun than I expected.

00:20:57.640 --> 00:20:59.560
You stupid prince!

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:01.980
Come back to your senses!

00:21:01.980 --> 00:21:02.810
I'm Greed.

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:03.770
I don't care!

00:21:03.770 --> 00:21:05.270
Give Ling back his body.

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:07.610
No can do!

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:15.160
What are you, an idiot?!

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:16.910
What are you going to do about your country?!

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:18.790
What about Lan Fan?!

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:28.420
PLACEHOLDER

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:30.760
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:30.760
Father! I got him.

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:34.430
Take him upstairs, where Wrath is.

00:21:36.300 --> 00:21:39.810
Seriously... Always screwing around with us...

00:21:39.810 --> 00:21:44.640
As long as you guys behave, we won't do a thing.

00:21:45.940 --> 00:21:46.940
Brother.

00:21:48.770 --> 00:21:49.900
He...

00:21:50.610 --> 00:21:51.650
Ling...

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:53.450
...is inside of him.

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:07.550
Even if we part and meet again, I want to meet at this place.

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:07.550
Megurimeguttemo mata koko de aitai

00:22:07.640 --> 00:22:14.480
Then we'll hold hands to ensure we'll never be separated again.

00:22:07.640 --> 00:22:14.480
Hagurenaiyouni kono te wo tsunagunda

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:17.110
We used to talk all night until the sun rose,

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:17.110
Asahi ga noboru made katariattane

00:22:17.110 --> 00:22:19.940
And held hands till the sun went under the horizon.

00:22:17.110 --> 00:22:19.940
Yuuhi ga shizumu made tsunaida te

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:25.190
Let's walk together like this forever, like light and shadow.

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:25.190
Kouyatte asu mo asatte mo tomo ni ayumou hikari to kage

00:22:25.280 --> 00:22:29.740
I stand in the city, staring off into space with lonely eyes.

00:22:25.280 --> 00:22:29.740
Samishige ni mitsumeru machi no naka de

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:35.080
I can't find warmth on my own.

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:35.080
Nukumori wa hitori ja mitsukaranakute

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:40.590
By meeting you, I realized

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:40.590
Ai ga konnani tsuyosa ni narukoto

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:46.420
How much strength love could give me.

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:46.420
Shittanda kimi ni deaete hajimete

00:22:46.420 --> 00:22:51.680
Even if we part and meet again, I want to meet at this place.

00:22:46.420 --> 00:22:51.680
Megurimeguttemo mata koko de aitai

00:22:51.680 --> 00:22:56.980
Then we'll hold hands to ensure we'll never be separated again.

00:22:51.680 --> 00:22:56.980
Hagurenaiyouni kono te wo tsunagunda

00:22:56.980 --> 00:23:02.190
I can't sleep by myself, 'cause I can't dream without you.

00:22:56.980 --> 00:23:02.190
Hitori ja nemurenai yume wa mirenaikara

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:07.950
So take me to a place where uncertainty can't reach us

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:07.950
Donna fuan mo todokanai tokoro e

00:23:07.950 --> 00:23:13.200
And let us bring light to the night sky with no stars.

00:23:07.950 --> 00:23:13.200
Hoshi no yoru mo terashitsuzukeyou

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:15.700
So long as you're with me, I can go to world's end.

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:15.700
Doko made mo yukeru kimi to nara

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:18.710
Even if it's a path I can't walk on my own,

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:18.710
Hitori ja arukenai michi mo futari nara

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:21.750
If you're by my side, I can walk it while humming a tune.

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:21.750
Hanauta utainagara arukerunda

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:25.170
If we're together, the world is mine.

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:25.170
Kimi ga ireba shiawase

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:34.750
You used up your regeneration abilities, huh?

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:38.170
Worry not, my son.

00:23:51.310 --> 00:23:53.940
I will recreate you.

00:23:53.940 --> 00:23:56.070
With your memories, of course.

00:24:00.180 --> 00:24:05.060
Humans in chaos, struggle and writhe in agony.

00:24:05.060 --> 00:24:07.940
Because that serves as proof that one is alive.

00:24:08.560 --> 00:24:12.820
And struggle and kneel before me.

00:24:13.440 --> 00:24:17.990
Next time, Fullmetal Alchemist:

00:24:17.990 --> 00:24:21.990
Struggle of the Fool

00:24:17.990 --> 00:24:21.990
Episode 29, Struggle of the Fool.

00:24:22.530 --> 00:24:27.250
Will the man who had his limbs twisted be able to stand again?
